    <defName>Sukuna_Kamutoke</defName>
    <label>Kamutoke</label>
    <description>A cursed tool that holds a storm. In the hand of a sorcerer of psycast level 10 or above, it calls lightning down on nearby enemies, chaining between them and hitting mechanoids hardest. In anyone else's hand it is an ordinary blade.</description>
